==Battleground==
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cli-One]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For this early in Labyrinth, this stage can trip you up hard if you're going in mostly blind. The Alien enemies are at a concerningly competent magnification, so an anti-Alien Uber would be a good idea here.

